    "title": "Celebrate Mardi Gras with classic NOLA Cuisine and a side of Jazz at Louisiana Bistreaux - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ATL Live Staff ,\n1 days ago ATLANTA, Ga. (ATL Live) - Today ATL Live celebrated Mardi Gras with a visit from one of Atlanta’s best-known Cajun Cuisine kitchens- Louisiana Bistreaux. Area Director, Kyle Schexnayder, and owner, Feroz Delawalla, stopped by with some of their most popular dishes as well as their specialty hurricanes- perfect for riding out a wave of partying. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
